Nonlinear Magnetic Orbital Hall Effect Induced by Spin-Orbit Coupling
Hui Wang,1, ∗ Huiying Liu,2, † Yanfeng Ge,3, ∗ Xukun Feng,4 Jiaojiao Zhu,5
