group list in Table. S1 of Supplemental Material [29]),
which constitute a large class of compensated collinear
AFMs. In this class, the linear T -odd MOHE and nonlinear T -even OHE are forbidden by PT , and only the
linear T -even OHE and T -odd nonlinear MOHE can be
allowed. It is to be noted that since the global inversion
symmetry of the two sectors is preserved in PT AFMs,
the crystal structure of the system is centrosymmetric,
which is distinct from the intrinsic NOHE [30] in nonmagnetic systems, where the global inversion symmetry
must be broken.

