CPOC provides a compelling avenue for controlling the
nonlinear orbital torque generated from CuMnAs. When
the (001) plane is the contact interface to the target ferromagnet, for n ∥ [001], a sizable out-of-plane CPOC via
χzzyy is allowed in response to a driving current in the xy
plane, as shown in Fig. 2(a), which generates an out-of-

